<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on Pfizer Inc..</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on Pfizer Inc..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued nine million American-style call warrants, on Pfizer Inc. Swiss Certificate, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. Bank said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    100 CHF		   PREMIUM	25.84 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.20 CHF		  GEARING	7.42 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 17.JUL.97-15.JAN.99   PAYDATE	16.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXHANGE	   MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  89 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE    GSJT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
